[448.85833, "o", "request ID: 11a7dcd757ab4ea8915b904c2b7216a7\r\ncommand: 2b0e00f426ed41468d1bc35ffcdefd30\r\ncfg=(256, 128, 64, 8, 8, 3) time=2.586ms margin=0.2229\r\ncfg=(256, 128, 32, 8, 8, 4) time=2.511ms margin=0.2220\r\ncfg=(256, 256, 32, 8, 8, 3) time=40.007ms margin=0.2220\r\ncfg=(128, 256, 32, 8, 8, 4) time=2.895ms margin=0.2220\r\ncfg=(256, 128, 64, 4, 8, 3) time=2.596ms margin=0.2229\r\ncfg=(256, 128, 64, 16, 8, 3) time=2.615ms margin=0.2229\r\ncfg=(128, 128, 32, 8, 8, 6) time=3.097ms margin=0.2220\r\ncfg=(256, 64, 64, 8, 8, 4) FAILED: OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci\r\n"]
